------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What this repository contains
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Original Lua, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript written for FiveM / QBCore.
No Grand Theft Auto V, GTA Online, or other Take-Two / Rockstar game files.
No streamed models, textures, audio, or escrow binaries.
No copies of qb-core, qb-inventory, qb-target, oxmysql, or other frameworks.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software (not shipped — you install these yourself)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- FiveM / Cfx.re citizenfx runtime (their terms apply to your server)
- QBCore Framework (separate project, separate license)
- oxmysql (separate project, separate license)
- qb-inventory / qb-target / qb-ambulancejob / ps-ui (optional or required
  as listed in README; separate projects)

This resource calls those resources through public events and exports only.
It does not patch qb-core, qb-weapons, or qb-inventory.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party fonts (loaded by the NUI at runtime, not copied here)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The oil gauge may load Barlow Condensed and IBM Plex Mono from Google Fonts.
Those families are published under the SIL Open Font License.
See https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

